      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "ROMEO.\nWith Rosaline, my ghostly father? No.\nI have forgot that name, and that name’s woe.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
